$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM C-O-D ring system 3a: To a solution of tripeptide 2 (31.5 mg, 0.0263
mmol), CuBr•Me2S (23.0 mg, 0.112 mmol) and K2CO3 (15.3 mg, 0.0580 mmol)
in degassed MeCN (5 mL) at 25 °C was added pyridine (15 μL, 0.0619 mmol).
The resulting mixture was refluxed for 0.5 h. The reaction mixture was
then cooled to 25 °C, diluted with EtOAc (25 mL) and quenched with
saturated aqueous NH4Cl (5 mL). The mixture was stirred for 0.5 h and
then the aqueous phase was extracted with EtOAc (3 x 10 mL). The combined
organic extract was washed with brine (2 x 10 mL), dried (Na2SO4) and
filtered through a pad of silica gel. The solvent was removed in vacuo
and the residue was purified by flash column chromatography (silica gel,
20% EtOAc in hexanes) to afford C-O-D ring system 3a (27.6 mg, 94%) C-O-D
ring system 3a, yield (27.6 mg, 94%). Rf = 0.33 (silica gel 30% EtOAc in
hexanes); [α]D 22 = -22.3 (c = 1.4, CH3OH); IR (thin film) νmax = 2933,
1671, 1466, 1425, 1256, 1181, 1040 cm-1; 1H NMR (600 MHz, CD3COCD3) δ =
8.12 (br, 1Η, NH-5), 7.88 (d, J = 7.9 Hz, 1Η, NH-6), 7.45 (d, J = 8.8 Hz,
1H, H-6f), 7.31 (d, J = 8.8 Hz, 2 H, H-5b) 7.31 (s, 1H, H-4f), 6.83 (d, J
= 9.2 Hz, 2 H, H-5c), 6.58 (s, 1 H, H-4b), 6.57 (d, J = 8.3 Hz, 1Η,
H-6e); 6.06 (br, 1H NH-4), 5.79 (d, J = -2.2 Hz, 1Η, Ηβ), 5.63 (d, J =
8.3 Hz, 1 Η, Ηα), 5.51 (d, J = 8.3 Hz, 1 H, H-5α), 5.27 (dd, J = 10.1,
2.6 Hz, 1H, Ηα), 4.27-4.21 (m, 1 H, OCHHCH3), 4.15-4.09 (m, 1H, OCHHCH3),
3.87 (br; 2 Η, NCH2), 3.74 (s, 3 Η, CH3O), 3.64 (br, 2 Η, NCH2); 2.06
(br, 2 Η, NCH2CH2), 2.03 (br, 2 Η, NCH2CH2), 1.59 (sept, J = 7.9 Hz, 3 Η,
CHSi), 1.42 (s, 9 Η, t-BuO), 1.30 (t, J = 7.4 Hz, 3 H, OCH2CH3), 1.26 (d,
J = 7.4 Hz, 9 Η, (CH3)2CHSi), 1.21 (d, J = 7.9 Hz, 9 Η, (CH3)2CHSi), 0.89
(s, 9 Η, t-BuSi), 0.10(s, 3 H, CH3Si), -0.07 (s, 3 Η, CH3Si); 13C NMR
(150 MHz, CD3COCD3): δ = 171.7, 169.9, 168.9, 160.1, 158.6, 154.4, 152.6,
151.3, 141.1, 137.8, 131.9, 129.1, 129.0, 127.1, 124.5, 119.2, 118.1,
115.4, 115.2, 114.5, 79.8, 71.8, 62.1, 56.7, 55.6, 55.4, 51.6, 47.0,
28.4, 25.9, 24.6,24:1, 18.7, 15.6, 14.3, -4.0, -5.1; HRMS (MALDI-FTMS)
